	(text "BIT MAP  (QA..QH of each chip; data shifts CH1 chip0 -> CH1 chip1 -> CH2 chip0 -> ... -> CH4 chip1)\nchip 0: QA P48 | QB PAD | QC PHASE | QD HPF | QE MIC_SEL | QF LINE_SEL | QG HIZ_SEL | QH PRE (fader pre/post-EQ)\nchip 1: QA LF_CUT | QB LF_MODE | QC LMF_CUT | QD HMF_CUT | QE HF_CUT | QF HF_MODE | QG INSERT | QH MIX_ON (1 = on mix bus)\nSend 64 bits MSB-first: the first bit clocked in ends at CH4 chip1 QH (CH4 MIX_ON), the last at CH1 chip0 QA (CH1 P48),\nthen pulse LAT. Read-back: the 64 bits come out again on SR_DOUT (connector pin 8) on the next 64 clocks."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 330 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "145eb279-7f00-402b-9b10-08ee68e15936")
	)
	(text "/OE power-up hold-off: 1u to +3V3 + 1M to GND keeps all\n64 logic outputs Hi-Z (cards default via their pull-downs,\nchannels muted) for ~1.2 s while the controller loads the\nchain. Pin 7 may drive /OE directly instead (optional)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.242 250.444 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "392db4d1-052e-4296-8802-a55300d31683")
	)
